    },
    {
      "v": "maks",
      "t": "Та же консистенция.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Same texture.' -- Maks defends his work. The word '' means 'the same' for feminine nouns. ENG",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "maks",
      "t": "И состав я подобрал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And I got the ingredients right.' -- He is sure he used the correct recipe. ENG",
